The fourth quest
The fourth quest requires you to travel through the magical forest, then assassinate the unseelers commander.
Just like the previous quests, receive it from the story mode, go to crystal city, then enter the magical forest. You'll find a difficult challenge inside. some of the time you will have to climb up to find the way, other times will have to use your camera to find a safe platform to land on, while sometimes you'll have to jump over the different bombs placed in the forest. Note, this is the most difficult quest, so be careful, keep trying if you fail, and over all keep a cool head on your shoulders and you'll definitely complete it sometime!
When you reach the end you'll be required to press shift enter. Heal your health, then press shift enter. You’ll be moved to the forest exit, where the unseelers commander will be waiting for you. Begin the fight and defeat him, then move to complete the quest.